# Keep Cloud Build uploads small and free of credentials.
.git
.gcloudignore
AGENTS.md
README.md
docs

# The API image only needs Backend/.
Frontend

# Dependencies, build output, and test artifacts are rebuilt in Cloud Build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/coverage
**/logs
**/*.log

# Never upload local environment files or key material.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/service-account*.json
**/firebase-debug.log
